# Bullseye, Death Dealer: the enter trigger may discard a nonland card instead (CR 701.9, 603.12). Bot1 casts it with three Moxen,
# chooses to discard, and Lightning Bolt is the only card it may name (the Mountains are lands): the reflexive trigger then
# deals 2 damage to Bot2. The Moxen all stay, since the discard was the choice.

[Bot1 Deck]
Bullseye, Death Dealer
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Bullseye, Death Dealer.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Modes(Discard a nonland card)
! Bot1.Choose(Mountain)
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt)
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 18
Bot1.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Hand = Mountain; Mountain
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Ruby; Mox Jet; Mox Sapphire; Bullseye, Death Dealer
Stack.Count = 0
